[CmdInfo]
Error code for commands. Doesn't have a use during gameplay. 
Code for unkown commands.
Exits the game.
Moves one space to the south.
Moves one space to the north.
Moves one space to the east.
Moves one space to the west.
Takes an object to the current space. Needs one argument. Ex: take Object1.
Drops an object to the current space. Needs one argument. Ex: drop Object1.
Chats with an NPC in the space. Needs one argument. Ex: chat NPC1.
If in exploration, it starts combat. In combat mode, attacks enemies. Takes no arguments
Exits combat.
Switches current player. Ex: switch list (gets player list). switch (swithches to next player). switch Id (switches to player with given Id)
Uses an ability. Takes one argument. Ex: ability 1.
Uses an ability of an object. Takes one argument. Ex: object_use ObjectName.
Prints all the commands if no arguments. If specified a command, prints its description.
Generic command for moving. Needs one argument (north, east, south, west). Ex: move north.
Searches in the current space to obtain info about NPCs and objects.

